# Build contexts here are the whole repo, and three services share it - so this is about upload
# size and build time, not correctness. Nothing ignored here is on the lobby, game master, or
# archive reference path. The browser head (which pulls the graphics/ImGui trees) is not built.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Generated/
**/.vs/
**/TestResults/
**/*.pdb

# Upstream trees and heavy tooling no server service builds.
kni/
luau/
Sokol.NET/
scratch/
FontStashSharp/samples/
SDL3-CS/
NFMWorld.ImGui.Browser/src/Generated/
NFMWorld.Graphics.Sokol/
NFMWorld.Browser/

# Local state
.git/
.env
NFMWorld.Archive/archive.db*
NFMWorld.Archive/storage/
/data/cfg/config.cfg
